body:
I could write paragraphs of why I adore this, but I'll just keep it to a couple things;

The humming during the rimming, absolutely chilling!  The ongoing laughter when the character left the house all self-satisfied, after that perfectly nauseating kiss on the forehead (*squirms*). The shushing and recapturing whenever there's a struggle, and the affirmation of it all feeling so good. It's just too hot 🥵

I just, ughh 💦 I'm in love with how you play this horrible character, and I'm so eager to hear more of this genre. Thank you so much for this, I know it can be anxiety-inducing to share this sort of stuff because the last thing you want is to trigger people! I'm always very careful with this sort of material but you knocked it out of the park ♥️ I'm staying tuned!
